<h3 class="help first">What this tool does</h3>
<p class="help">The flagship tool of the MetaForge Suite, Intelli-Tagger ensures that the metadata for your MP3s is robust and useful.<br> AI assisted logic enforces a clear genre and sub-genre system. It also calculates qualitative acoustic data like Mood, Intensity, and BPM to support the Intelligent Playlist Maker.</p>

